# Below level 40 (before Incinerate) this priority has no filler and shows Life Tap between its DoTs, as wowsims's own list would at that level.

# Generated by `make wowsims-packs` (tools/wowsims/apl.lua) from tools/wowsims/specs/warlock_destruction.lua: edit that recipe, not this file.
# Setting assigned_curse (choice of curseOptions: elements, nocurse, recklessness, weakness), default elements in game and in the harness.
# Deviation: precombat #1: the pre-pull time uses the kit's base cast time; wowsims uses the hasted cast.
# Dropped (movement): default #3: unitIsMoving
# Movement: default #3 reaches default: hellfire
# Omitted: precombat #2: petAttack
# Omitted: default #3: move
# Omitted: default #5: castSpell on another target (Target index 1)
# Omitted: default #6: changeTarget
# Omitted: single_multi_target_curse_logic #2: changeTarget
